This life size Santa Claus decoration features a classic design dressed in traditional red and white attire. He holds a golden gift box and carries lush green foliage on his back for nostalgic charm. The figure is crafted from durable polyester to maintain its shape and vibrant colour throughout the festive season.

The voice-activated mechanism allows this animated Santa to turn his head and wave his hand when he hears noise. It also plays cheerful music while delivering festive greetings to create a joyful atmosphere. You can easily activate the motion by speaking or using the control button for convenient operation.

Fifteen warm white twinkling LEDs are embedded in the Santa's gift bag to create a magical holiday ambience. These lights gently glow to elevate your Christmas decor with an enchanting and cosy visual effect. The combination of motion, sound, and light provides multiple sensory benefits for guests.

Running on three AA batteries not included, this figure offers cordless convenience for easy placement anywhere indoors. Its compact power source eliminates the hassle of managing power cords near electrical outlets. This battery operation ensures safe use around children and pets during parties or family gatherings.

The overall dimensions measure 53 centimetres in length, 27 centimetres in width, and 120 centimetres in height. Assembly is simple requiring only the attachment of legs and shoes for immediate display. This practical detail ensures you can set up your festive decoration quickly without complex tools or instructions.
